msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_LIEUTENANT01448_000_010:1"
msgid "Pray return to Gridania and make directly for the Lotus Stand─the conjurer at Nophica's Altar will be expecting your arrival. Fare you well, <if ($gn52 > 0)><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: よくぞ戻られた。<br>カヌ・エ様が、貴殿の到着を心待ちにしておいでだ。<br>「不語仙の座卓」に向かうか？
#. de: Willkommen zurück. Soll ich dich wieder zum Wasserrosentisch geleiten?
#. fr: Kan-E-Senna et vos compagnons vous attendent à la Chaire du Lotus. Si vous voulez bien me suivre...
#. speaker: DOORMANLOTUS
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_DOORMANLOTUS_000_020:1"
msgid "Welcome back, honored Scion. We who knew of your mission have been most anxious to see you return. The Elder Seedseer awaits you within."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「不語仙の座卓」に移動しますか？
#. de: Dich zum Wasserrosentisch führen lassen?
#. fr: Se rendre à la Chaire du Lotus<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_Q1_000_021:1"
msgid "Proceed to the Lotus Stand?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_A1_000_022:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
#. speaker: A1
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_A1_000_023:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 仮宿で、マキシオにお礼を言われたよ。<br>なかなか楽しかったから、また一緒に遊ぼうってさ。
#. de: Maxio hat sich extra noch mal bedankt! Wir sollen bald wieder in der Zuflucht vorbeischauen, sagt sie! Also ich freu mich schon darauf.
#. fr: Maxio était tout excité de nous voir revenir au Refuge. Il nous a remerciés pour “cette divertissante excursion”. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment à nous, le petit gars s'est bien amusé, j'ai l'impression.
#. speaker: YDA
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_YDA_000_030:1"
msgid "You should have seen Maxio when we got back to Little Solace. Grateful is an understatement! I thought he was going to shake Papalymo's hand off!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ほら、胸を張ってカヌ・エ様に報告するといい。<br>君は素晴らしい手柄を立てたんだからさ。
#. de: Nun erzähl der Ältesten Saatseherin doch schon, was du geleistet hast. Darauf kannst du ruhig stolz sein.
#. fr: Eh bien, qu'attends-tu pour parler à Kan-E-Senna<nbsp>? Ne me dis pas qu'elle t'intimide<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: PAPALYMO
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_PAPALYMO_000_035:1"
msgid "Ah, the hero of the hour! Let us not keep the Elder Seedseer waiting."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 先の蛮神「リヴァイアサン」のときは、<br>それなりに力になれたと思うんだけどな。<br>今回は……まあ……聞かないでおくよ。
#. de: Bei den Äthermessungen im Finsterwald war ich nicht besonders hilfreich, musst du wissen. Sogar ich habe eben manchmal einen schlechten Tag.
#. fr: Je n'ai pas eu l'occasion de m'illustrer sur le champ de bataille, cette fois... C'est dommage, j'avais pris mes dagues préférées avec moi...<br>Oups<nbsp>! j'ai fait une rime<nbsp>!<nbsp>... J-je suis bien moi, rassurez-vous<nbsp>! Hahaha...<nbsp>!
#. speaker: THANCRED
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_THANCRED_000_040:1"
msgid "I fancy my presence was more help than hindrance during our troubles with Leviathan, but this time around... Well, even I have my off days!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: イダとパパリモの目論見も、私の見解も、<br>ある意味どちらも正解だったわけね……。<br>もう少し、イダの話も聞いてみるべきかもしれない。
#. de: Um in Frieden mit den Wilden Stämmen leben zu können, müssen wir endlich unsere eigenen Konflikte lösen.
#. fr: Avec le recul, je trouve que l'approche d'Yda était plutôt sensée. Nous ne fonctionnons pas du tout de la même façon, et je réalise maintenant que c'est un avantage plutôt qu'une gêne. Je lui dois des excuses.
#. speaker: YSHTOLA
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_YSHTOLA_000_045:1"
msgid "'Twould seem that Yda's appraisal of the situation held some merit after all. Mayhap I should not be so swift to discount her intuition..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 改めて……。<br>蛮神「ラムウ」の鎮圧、お疲れさま。
#. de: Damit ist die Sache Ramuh fürs erste zu den Akten gelegt. 
#. fr: Eh bien, ce fut un travail intense et harassant. Je pensais que nous pourrions régler le problème par la seule discussion, mais j'étais trop optimiste...
#. speaker: PAPALYMO
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_PAPALYMO_000_60:1"
msgid "Thus ends another daunting mission, eh, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 僕らが考えていた、対話による和解とは違った結末だったけれど、<br>十分に納得できる結果だったと思うよ。
#. de: Ein Paradebeispiel von Diplomatie war es nicht, aber ich würde mal sagen, das Ergebnis zählt. 
#. fr: Enfin, tout ce qui compte, c'est que tu sois arrivé<if $gn4>e</if> à gagner la confiance du Seigneur de la forêt... et que tu sois sain<if $gn4>e</if> et sau<if $gn4>ve<else>f</if>, bien entendu<nbsp>!
#. speaker: PAPALYMO
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_PAPALYMO_000_061:1"
msgid "I'd hoped Lord Ramuh could be persuaded with words alone, but nonetheless, I can only admire the adroitness with which you responded to the primal's sudden challenge."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ウリエンジェも、何か掴んだそうじゃないか。<br>さっそく「石の家」に戻って、この一件をまとめよう。<br>ミンフィリアも、君の帰りを待ちわびてるはずだ。
#. de: Urianger scheint etwas entdeckt zu haben, sagt Minfilia. Wir sollten rasch in den Sonnenstein zurückkehren und hören, was es damit auf sich hat.
#. fr: J'ai cru comprendre qu'Urianger avait fait une découverte importante en t'observant combattre le Primordial. Je propose que nous retournions au Refuge des roches et que nous fassions le point avec lui et Minfilia.
#. speaker: PAPALYMO
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_PAPALYMO_000_062:1"
msgid "And it seems that Urianger, too, was pleased with the outcome. What say you, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>? Shall we gather back at the Rising Stones and ponder the lessons of the day?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: さっそく「石の家」に戻って、この一件をまとめよう。<br>ミンフィリアも、君の帰りを待ちわびてるはずだ。
#. de: Kehren wir in den Sonnenstein zurück! Ich bin gespannt, was Urianger Neues herausgefunden haben könnte.
#. fr: Je me suis permis de contacter Minfilia pour la rassurer. Elle m'a dit qu'elle avait hâte de nous revoir. Retournons sans attendre au Refuge des roches et faisons le point tous ensemble.
#. speaker: PAPALYMO
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_PAPALYMO_000_070:1"
msgid "I am sure that Minfilia will be eager to hear more of your adventures. Let us return to the Rising Stones and put our thoughts in order."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お帰りなさい！<br>蛮神「ラムウ」の件、さっき連絡を受けたところよ。
#. de: Willkommen zurück! Du konntest den Konflikt mit Ramuh also beilegen. 
#. fr: Papalymo m'a appelée pour m'annoncer la bonne nouvelle. Mes félicitations, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Tu as fait de l'excellent travail, comme d'habitude.
#. speaker: MINFILIA
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_MINFILIA_000_080:1"
msgid "Welcome back, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Word of your momentous encounter with Lord Ramuh precedes you!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: わたしからも、あなたに伝えたいことがあって……<br>でも、まずはウリエンジェさんの報告が先ね。
#. de: Ich würde gerne in Ruhe unter vier Augen mit dir sprechen, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> - aber zunächst sollten wir uns alle versammeln. Du hast ja gehört, dass Urianger uns wichtige Ergebnisse seiner Unter<shy>such<shy>ungen mitzuteilen hat.
#. fr: Pendant ton absence, j'ai reçu un document qui devrait t'intéresser. Je t'en dirai plus long après. Pour l'instant, j'aimerais qu'on se concentre sur quelque chose de plus urgent.
#. speaker: MINFILIA
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_MINFILIA_000_081:1"
msgid "I would fain share news of mine own, but Urianger's discoveries must take precedence."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 蛮神「ラムウ」との戦いを見ていて、<br>アシエンにも関係する、重大な発見をしたそうなの。<br>さっそく、みんなを集めましょう。
#. de: Er hat den Kampf gegen Ramuh mit dem Ätherspektroskop aufgezeichnet und seine Beobachtungen mit unserem Wissen über die Ascians verknüpft.
#. fr: Urianger a fait une découverte capitale qui pourrait nous permettre de vaincre définitivement les Asciens. J'ai fait appeler tes camarades pour qu'on en discute tous ensemble.
#. speaker: MINFILIA
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_MINFILIA_000_082:1"
msgid "Upon witnessing your defeat of the Lord of Levin, our learned companion was struck with a profound insight regarding the nature of the Ascians' immortality. Let us assemble and discuss his observations together."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・イゲオルム-)<ui-color 547>水神リヴァイアサンに続き、雷神ラムウまでも……。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Igeyorhm-)<ui-color 547>Nach dem Herren der Wogen nun auch Ramuh ...</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Igeyorhm-)<ui-color 547>Ramuh est retourné à l'éther, tout comme Léviathan avant lui.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANA01453
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ASCIANA01453_000_200:1"
msgid "(-Igeyorhm-)<ui-color 547>The Lord of Levin is returned to the aether, as was Leviathan before him.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・ナプリアレス-)<ui-color 547>まさか雷神が、光の使徒を受け入れるとはね。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Nabriales-)<ui-color 547>Erstaunlich, dass der Herr der Blitze <if $gn4>die Lichtkriegerin<else>den Lichtkrieger</if> einfach so gewähren lässt.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Nabriales-)<ui-color 547>Son com<shy>por<shy>te<shy>ment à l'égard de cet<if $gn4>te</if> humain<if $gn4>e</if> était pour le moins... inattendu.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANB01453
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ASCIANB01453_000_201:1"
msgid "(-Nabriales-)<ui-color 547>Ramuh's acquiescence was most...intriguing.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・エメロロアルス-)<ui-color 547>……焔神、嵐神、岩神、水神、雷神。<br>彼の地で顕現可能な五大神は、<br>すべて、あの者に討たれたということになる。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Emmerololth-)<ui-color 547>In der Tat bemerkenswert. Damit hat <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> sich alle fünf Götter unterworfen, deren Beschwörung die Sterblichen bisher fähig waren.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Emmerololth-)<ui-color 547>Ifrit, Garuda, Titan, Léviathan et Ramuh... Les cinq grandes divinités de cette terre sont toutes tombées sous les coups <if $gn4>de la<else>du</if> Protégé<if $gn4>e</if> de la Lumière.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIANC01453
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ASCIANC01453_000_202:1"
msgid "(-Emmerololth-)<ui-color 547>Inferno, vortex, crag, whorl, and levin. All have now been humbled by the Bringer of Light.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・ウルテマ-)<ui-color 547>人の進化……。<br>エリディブス卿の言うとおりということか。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Altima-)<ui-color 547>Das ist die Fortentwicklung des suchenden Geistes ... so wie Ihr es vorhersagtet, mein Paraklet.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Altima-)<ui-color 547><if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> évolue comme tu l'avais prédit. Ce serait donc ça, le potentiel illimité de l'Homme...</ui-color>
#. speaker: ASCIAND01453
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ASCIAND01453_000_203:1"
msgid "(-Altima-)<ui-color 547>The limitless potential of man... Hydaelyn's servant grows mightier by the day.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・エリディブス-)<ui-color 547>はたして、ハイデリンの意思か。<br>人は、七度の「次元圧壊」を生き延び、<br>「人ならざる者」に進化しようとしている。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Oder ist es Hydaelyns Wirken? Sieben Vereinigungen der Welten haben die Unvollkommenen hinter sich, und nun ist es Zeit, ihre Klinge des Lichts zu ihrem wahren Selbst erwachen zu lassen.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Hydaelyn est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment derrière tout cela... Les humains ont survécu à la Réunion à sept reprises, mais à chaque fois leur capital physique s'est dégradé pour se rapprocher d'une forme plus spirituelle.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ELIDIBUSEORZEA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ELIDIBUSEORZEA_000_204:1"
msgid "(-Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Yet <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> prospers at great cost to <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> mistress...whose strength is all too finite. Seven times have the masses survived the Rejoining, but their souls are grown weak and wan...</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-アシエン・エリディブス-)<ui-color 547>だが、「アーダー」による、絶対神「ゾディアーク」様の再生。<br>その最後の欠片は、覚醒せし人の「人たる者」への進化だ。</ui-color>
#. de: (-Ascian Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Mit jeder Nova rückt die Wiederherstellung der Kräfte des Absoluten näher. Das fehlende Glied ist einzig, <if $gn4>die Erwachte<else>den Erwachten</if> zum vollen Bewusstsein <if $gn4>ihres<else>seines</if> Wesens zu führen - den letzten Schlüssel zu schmieden.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Malgré tout, l'Ardor renforce le pouvoir de notre maître. Tout ce qui nous reste à faire désormais, c'est de trouver le moyen de faire d'un être éveillé un simple humain.</ui-color>
#. speaker: ELIDIBUSEORZEA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_ELIDIBUSEORZEA_000_205:1"
msgid "(-Elidibus-)<ui-color 547>Yet even as it enervates, the Ardor empowers our master. All that remains is to nurture the strength of the gifted─to forge the final key.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-？？？？-)<ui-color 547>……ならば、それを成すことも、我々に課せられた使命。</ui-color>
#. de: (-???-)<ui-color 547>Dann soll dies auch meine heilige Pflicht sein.</ui-color>
#. fr: (-???-)<ui-color 547>... Et c'est à cette tâche que nous devons consacrer tous nos efforts.</ui-color>
#. speaker: LAHABREAEORZEA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_LAHABREAEORZEA_000_206:1"
msgid "(-???-)<ui-color 547>...And that is the task to which we bend our every effort.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>かの地、エオルゼアが神々に愛される理由……。<br>そのために、新たな「知」を人にあたえ、新たな「神」を導く。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Eorzea, von den Göttern geliebt und vom Urkristall beseelt ... in der Tat. Schon seit Anbeginn war dieses Land fruchtbar - empfänglich für göttliche Saat. Lasst uns <if $gn4>der Lichtträgerin<else>dem Lichtträger</if> das Wissen schenken, um einem <i>neuen Gott</i> den Weg zu bereiten.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Le sol d'Éorzéa n'a jamais été propice à la germination des graines divines, mais en donnant aux hommes les outils nécessaires, ils pourront un jour cultiver leurs propres dieux.</ui-color>
#. speaker: LAHABREAEORZEA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_LAHABREAEORZEA_000_207:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Divine seeds were ever wont to quicken in Eorzea's fertile soil. We need only lead men to the field, and by their eager hands shall a new deity arise.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>すべての世界をひとつにし、「原初の理」を得るために。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Was einst zerschlagen wurde, soll verschmelzen. Die Erste Ordnung wird erneut errichtet ... zu des Absoluten Gottes Herrlichkeit.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Ce qui a été séparé doit être rassemblé. Ainsi le Dieu véritable pourra revenir.</ui-color>
#. speaker: LAHABREAEORZEA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/GaiUse312_01453:TEXT_GAIUSE312_01453_LAHABREAEORZEA_000_208:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>That which was shattered shall be made anew...and the one true god shall come again.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""
